00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.866
Noibat!

271
00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.200
Noibat!

272
00:17:14.733 --> 00:17:16.500
We can't break through the bars.

273
00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:24.833
Noibat!

274
00:17:26.066 --> 00:17:28.633
Hang in there, Noibat. Floette needs you.

275
00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:31.066
If you wanna help, you can't give up.

276
00:17:31.266 --> 00:17:32.133
Noibat.

277
00:17:39.666 --> 00:17:40.666
Noibat.

278
00:17:40.733 --> 00:17:43.966
Noibat, no. If you keep banging on the cage like that,

279
