you're gonna break before that cage does.

280
00:17:48.133 --> 00:17:49.100
Oh, Noibat.

281
00:17:50.133 --> 00:17:50.966
Noibat.

282
00:17:53.733 --> 00:17:56.100
Whoa, check it out. What is that?

283
00:17:56.433 --> 00:17:58.366
- Acrobatics.
- A new move.

284
00:18:07.766 --> 00:18:09.133
Yay! It worked.

285
00:18:11.133 --> 00:18:12.000
Noibat.

286
00:18:15.666 --> 00:18:16.966
Breloom, Breloom.

287
00:18:17.266 --> 00:18:18.333
Noibat.

288
00:18:18.766 --> 00:18:19.800
Arg.

289
00:18:20.066 --> 00:18:23.300
