292
00:18:35.033 --> 00:18:40.500
Breloom!

293
00:18:44.966 --> 00:18:47.533
We're blasting off again!

294
00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:50.033
- Wobbuffet.
- Inkay.

295
00:18:51.666 --> 00:18:53.800
- You were great, Noibat.
- Pika, pika.

296
00:18:53.866 --> 00:18:55.733
- You got them out.
- Pika.

297
00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:56.833
Noibat.

298
00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:58.666
Hawlucha.

299
00:19:17.966 --> 00:19:20.000
Breloom. Breloom.

300
00:19:23.566 --> 00:19:25.500
- Noibat.
- Breloom!

301
00:19:26.033 --> 00:19:29.566
- They're at it again. Ha, ha.
- Breloom just can't take a hint.

302
00:19:41.866 --> 00:19:43.400
Hey, look at that.

303
00:19:49.133 --> 00:19:50.400
Floette.

304
00:19:50.466 --> 00:19:52.866
