310
00:20:04.733 --> 00:20:07.366
Noibat. Noibat.

311
00:20:07.433 --> 00:20:10.500
Breloom.

312
00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:14.600
- Cha-hawlu.
- Breloom.

313
00:20:21.066 --> 00:20:25.366
